# About Me

Something interesting about myself, my background, and my skills. An introduction to who I am and what I do. How I got into my field, what motivates me, and what I am passionate about.

# Professional Experience

1. Worked somewhere, doing something important.
2. Describe your role, responsibilities, and achievements in this position.
3. Highlight any significant projects or contributions you made.

# Education

1. Where I studied, what degree I earned, and any relevant coursework or honors.
2. Mention any extracurricular activities or leadership roles you held during your education.

# Projects

1. Projects I have worked on, including personal projects, open-source contributions, or freelance work.
2. Describe each of them briefly, or use an `@projects` block and build individual pages for each project.
3. Keep the descriptions concise and focused on the impact or results of the projects.

# Articles

1. Any articles, blog posts, or publications I have written.
2. Use an `@articles` block to automatically list out your articles.

